# RAKSHA AI — Production Integration Plan

## Summary
Full production-grade integration of 4 AI providers (Google Gemini, HuggingFace, Groq, Mistral)
with secure credential management, centralized config validation, and deployment hardening.

## Architectural Issues Found

| Issue | Severity | File |
|-------|----------|------|
| No `.env` file exists — 0 of 4 keys configured | 🔴 Critical | backend/ |
| `RakshaConfig` uses class-level `os.getenv()` — fragile import-order dependency | 🟡 Medium | providers.py |
| `google-generativeai` in requirements but code uses raw `httpx` REST | 🟡 Medium | requirements.txt |
| No centralized startup validation — app silently starts without keys | 🟡 Medium | main.py |
| `ai_core.py` duplicates cloud AI call already in `gemma_client.py` | 🟠 Low | ai_core.py |
| `startup.py` only checks Google key and optionals — no Groq/Mistral connectivity tests | 🟠 Low | startup.py |
| `docker-compose.yml` missing `POLLINATIONS_MODEL`, `APP_NAME` env vars | 🟠 Low | docker-compose.yml |
| No GitHub Actions CI/CD workflow | 🟠 Low | Missing |
| `.gitignore` lacks `*.env.*`, `backend/*.db` patterns | 🟠 Low | .gitignore |

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Credentials & Security

#### [CREATE] backend/.env
Real credentials loaded at runtime, never committed (already in .gitignore).

#### [MODIFY] backend/.env.example
Updated with all 4 provider placeholders and complete documentation.

#### [MODIFY] .gitignore
Add `*.env.*`, `backend/*.db`, `*.db-shm`, `*.db-wal` patterns.

---

### 2. Centralized Config & Validation

#### [CREATE] backend/config.py
New module: startup config validator. Reads all env vars, validates types, raises
`EnvironmentError` with human-readable messages if required keys are missing. Called
from `main.py` before any provider is initialized.

#### [MODIFY] backend/providers.py
Fix `RakshaConfig.__init__` to re-read ALL env vars (not just CORS), making it
truly dynamic and test-safe. Class body becomes type annotations only.

---

### 3. Requirements

#### [MODIFY] backend/requirements.txt
- Remove `google-generativeai` (unused — code uses raw httpx REST API)
- Ensure `tenacity` is present for retry logic
- Pin versions for production stability

---

### 4. Startup Diagnostics

#### [MODIFY] backend/startup.py
Add connectivity probes for all 4 providers:
- Google AI API (model list endpoint)
- HuggingFace BLIP API (status check)
- Groq API (models endpoint)
- Mistral API (models endpoint)

---

### 5. Main App Startup

#### [MODIFY] backend/main.py
Add `config.validate()` call in the `lifespan` context manager so invalid config
fails fast at startup with clear error messages instead of silently degrading.

---

### 6. Deployment

#### [MODIFY] docker-compose.yml
Add all 4 env vars, add `POLLINATIONS_MODEL`, `APP_NAME`, `PORT`.

#### [CREATE] .github/workflows/ci.yml
GitHub Actions workflow: lint + syntax check on push to main.

#### [MODIFY] Dockerfile
Minor: add `--no-cache-dir` optimization and label metadata.

---

